### Define Simultaneous Gesture Recognition

Source: https://docs.swmansion.com/react-native-gesture-handler/docs/gestures/pan-gesture

Specifies that another gesture should be recognized at the same time as the current one. Important: This method only marks the relationship; the `otherGesture` must be added to a `GestureDetector` to be recognized.

